#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:202
msgid "Attempts — Last 30 Days"
msgstr "So'nggi 30 kundagi urinishlar"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:203
msgid ""
"Completed practice attempts per day. Gaps mean nobody finished a practice "
"that day — a flat line here is the earliest sign that engagement has stalled."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:211
msgid "Difficulty Levels"
msgstr "Qiyinlik darajasi"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:212
msgid ""
"How the published practices split across easy, medium and hard. Hard "
"practices are worth double rating points, so a library with no hard sets "
"caps how fast students can climb."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:224
msgid "Score Distribution"
msgstr "Ball taqsimoti"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:225
#, python-format
msgid ""
"How many attempts landed in each 10%% band. A pile-up at the low end usually "
"means the questions are unclear rather than that the students are weak."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:233
msgid "Student Ranks"
msgstr "Darajalar"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:234
msgid ""
"Novice under 50 points, Scholar under 150, Expert under 300, then "
"Grandmaster. Points come from every library — see the coverage section below."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:242
msgid "By Subject"
msgstr "Fan bo'yicha"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:243
msgid ""
"Published practices per subject. Subjects with no practices still appear "
"elsewhere on the platform, so a small slice here does not mean a small "
"library."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:255
msgid "Top Masters by Students"
msgstr "Top ustozlar (o'quvchilar soni bo'yicha)"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:256
msgid ""
"Masters ranked by how many students have selected them. Students pick their "
"own masters from their profile, so this reflects choice, not assignment."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:265
msgid "Library coverage"
msgstr "Kutubxona qamrovi"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:267
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The platform publishes %(total)s study items in total, and students have "
"completed them %(done)s times. Completions count every student separately, "
"so this number can pass the library size — two students finishing the same "
"story is two completions of one item."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:273
msgid "Every library, and how much has been finished"
msgstr "Har bir kutubxona va qancha qismi tugatilgani"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:275
msgid ""
"The bar shows completions against library size. This is the same data "
"students see on their own progress page, so the two can never disagree."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:297
msgid "Reach"
msgstr "Qamrov"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:299
msgid ""
"Points are the single measure of student effort — every finished item adds "
"to them, and the leaderboard is sorted by nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:305
msgid "Points earned"
msgstr "Yig'ilgan ball"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:310
msgid "Students with points"
msgstr "Balli o'quvchilar"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:314
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(active)s of %(total)s students have earned at least one point. The rest "
"have registered but not finished anything yet — they are the group worth "
"chasing."
msgstr ""

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:321
msgid "Rest of the platform"
msgstr "Platformaning qolgan qismi"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/home.html:323
msgid ""
"Content this dashboard used to leave out entirely. These are published "
"totals, not student activity."
msgstr ""

