#: games/journey.py:118
msgid "Valley of Numbers"
msgstr "Sonlar vodiysi"

#: games/journey.py:119
msgid ""
"From the first arithmetic to algebra and geometry — the road every other "
"road crosses."
msgstr ""
"Dastlabki arifmetikadan algebra va geometriyagacha — boshqa barcha yo'llar "
"kesib o'tadigan yo'l."

#: games/journey.py:131
msgid "Land of Words"
msgstr "So'zlar o'lkasi"

#: games/journey.py:132
msgid "A hundred lessons of English grammar, laid out as one long road west."
msgstr ""
"Ingliz tili grammatikasining yuzta darsi — g'arbga ketgan bitta uzun yo'l."

#: games/journey.py:144
msgid "Hangul Mountains"
msgstr "Hangul tog'lari"

#: games/journey.py:145
msgid ""
"A hundred lessons of Korean, from the Hangul letters up — mountain after "
"mountain."
msgstr ""
"Koreys tilining yuzta darsi, Hangul harflaridan boshlab — tog'dan tog'ga."

#: games/journey.py:157
msgid "Snow Steppe"
msgstr "Qorli dasht"

#: games/journey.py:158
msgid ""
"From the Cyrillic alphabet to the six cases — the long road across the snow."
msgstr "Kirill alifbosidan olti kelishikkacha — qorli dasht bo'ylab uzun yo'l."

#: games/journey.py:182
msgid "The open road"
msgstr "Ochiq yo'l"

#: games/journey.py:183
msgid "The forest"
msgstr "O'rmon"

#: games/journey.py:184
msgid "The river"
msgstr "Daryo"

#: games/journey.py:185
msgid "The mountains"
msgstr "Tog'lar"

#: games/journey.py:186
msgid "The caves"
msgstr "G'orlar"

#: games/journey.py:187
msgid "The desert"
msgstr "Cho'l"

#: games/journey.py:188
msgid "The gate"
msgstr "Darvoza"

#: games/journey.py:206
msgid "The Toll Post"
msgstr "Bojxona ustuni"

#: games/journey.py:207
msgid ""
"A striped pole blocks the road. The keeper leans out of his hut. \"The toll "
"is one right answer. I have no use for money out here.\""
msgstr ""
"Yo'lni chiziqli ustun to'sib turibdi. Qorovul kulbasidan bosh chiqaradi: "
"«Boj — bitta to'g'ri javob. Bu yerda pulning menga keragi yo'q»."

#: games/journey.py:208
msgid "He lifts the pole and waves you through without another word."
msgstr ""
"U ustunni ko'taradi va boshqa hech narsa demay, qo'l silkib o'tkazib "
"yuboradi."

#: games/journey.py:209
msgid ""
"The pole stays down. \"Take your time,\" he says. \"The road is not going "
"anywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"Ustun tushgan holicha qoladi. «Shoshilmang, — deydi u. — Yo'l qochib "
"ketmaydi»."

#: games/journey.py:211
msgid "The Caravan Master"
msgstr "Karvonboshi"

#: games/journey.py:212
msgid ""
"A caravan has stopped across the whole width of the road. The master will "
"only let you squeeze past if you are worth talking to."
msgstr ""
"Karvon yo'lning butun kengligini egallab to'xtagan. Karvonboshi faqat "
"suhbatga arziydigan odamni o'tkazadi."

#: games/journey.py:213
msgid "\"Travel well,\" she says, and the camels shuffle aside."
msgstr "«Yo'lingiz bexatar bo'lsin», — deydi u va tuyalar chetga suriladi."

#: games/journey.py:214
msgid "She turns back to her animals. The road stays blocked."
msgstr "U yana tuyalariga o'girildi. Yo'l to'sig'icha qolaveradi."

#: games/journey.py:216
msgid "The Carved Milestone"
msgstr "O'yma yo'l toshi"

#: games/journey.py:217
msgid ""
"A stone stands at the roadside with writing cut deep into it. The road ahead "
"blurs until the writing is read correctly."
msgstr ""
"Yo'l chetida tosh turibdi, unga yozuv chuqur o'yilgan. Yozuv to'g'ri "
"o'qilmaguncha, oldingi yo'l xiralashib turadi."

#: games/journey.py:218
msgid "The letters settle. The road ahead comes back into focus."
msgstr "Harflar joyiga tushadi. Oldingi yo'l yana ravshan ko'rinadi."

#: games/journey.py:219
msgid "The carving swims in front of your eyes and will not hold still."
msgstr "O'yma yozuv ko'z oldingizda suzib, bir joyda turmaydi."

#: games/journey.py:223
msgid "The Woodcutter"
msgstr "O'tinchi ayol"

#: games/journey.py:224
msgid ""
"A woodcutter rests her axe on a fallen trunk that lies across the path. "
"\"Help me think, and I will help you climb over.\""
msgstr ""
"O'tinchi ayol yo'lni to'sib yotgan yiqilgan tanaga boltasini qo'yib turibdi. "
"«Menga o'ylashga yordam bering, men sizga oshib o'tishga yordam beraman»."

#: games/journey.py:225
msgid "She rolls the trunk aside with one shove. She was never really stuck."
msgstr ""
"U tanani bir turtishda chetga dumalatadi. Aslida u qiynalayotgani ham yo'q "
"edi."

#: games/journey.py:226
msgid "She shrugs and goes back to sharpening her axe."
msgstr "U yelka qisib, yana boltasini charxlashga tushadi."

#: games/journey.py:228
msgid "The Talking Crow"
msgstr "Gapiradigan qarg‘a"

#: games/journey.py:229
msgid ""
"A crow drops onto the branch above you. \"Two paths,\" it says. \"I will "
"tell you which — after you tell me this.\""
msgstr ""
"Qarg'a boshingiz uzra shoxga qo'nadi. «Ikkita yo'l bor, — deydi u. — Qaysi "
"biri ekanini aytaman — avval siz menga buni ayting»."

#: games/journey.py:230
msgid "The crow flaps ahead and waits at the right turning."
msgstr "Qarg'a oldinga uchib, to'g'ri burilishda kutib turadi."

#: games/journey.py:231
msgid "The crow says nothing at all, which is somehow worse."
msgstr "Qarg'a umuman hech narsa demaydi — bu yanada yomonroq."

#: games/journey.py:233
msgid "The Thorn Wall"
msgstr "Tikanli devor"

#: games/journey.py:234
msgid ""
"Thorns have grown clean across the track. There is one gap, and only one, "
"and finding it takes thinking rather than pushing."
msgstr ""
"Tikanlar so'qmoqni butunlay to'sib o'sib ketgan. Bitta tirqish bor, faqat "
"bitta — uni topish uchun kuch emas, fikr kerak."

#: games/journey.py:235
msgid "The gap opens exactly where the reasoning said it would."
msgstr "Tirqish aynan mulohaza aytgan joydan ochiladi."

#: games/journey.py:236
msgid "The thorns hold. Pushing harder is not the answer here."
msgstr "Tikanlar bo'sh kelmaydi. Bu yerda kuchliroq itarish yechim emas."

#: games/journey.py:238
msgid "The Lost Child"
msgstr "Adashgan bola"

#: games/journey.py:239
msgid ""
"A child sits crying on a stump. She has a homework page in her hand and "
"cannot get past one question."
msgstr ""
"Bir qiz kunda ustida yig'lab o'tiribdi. Qo'lida uy vazifasi varag'i — bitta "
"savoldan o'ta olmayapti."

#: games/journey.py:240
msgid "She grins, folds the page away, and runs off shouting thanks."
msgstr "U jilmayadi, varaqni buklab qo'yadi va rahmat aytib yugurib ketadi."

#: games/journey.py:241
msgid "She looks up at you hopefully. You will have to come back to this."
msgstr "U umid bilan sizga qaraydi. Bunga yana qaytishingizga to'g'ri keladi."

#: games/journey.py:245
msgid "The Bridge Keeper"
msgstr "Ko'prik qorovuli"

#: games/journey.py:246
msgid ""
"An old man sits at the head of a rope bridge. \"Nobody crosses my bridge "
"without paying,\" he says. \"And I do not take money.\""
msgstr ""
"Arqonli ko'prik boshida bir chol o'tiribdi. «Mening ko'prigimdan hech kim "
"tekinga o'tmaydi, — deydi u. — Men pul olmayman ham»."

#: games/journey.py:247
msgid "He stands, bows, and steps aside. The planks hold."
msgstr ""
"U o'rnidan turib, ta'zim qiladi va chetga suriladi. Taxtalar bardosh beradi."

#: games/journey.py:248
msgid ""
"He shakes his head slowly and does not move from the middle of the bridge."
msgstr "U sekin bosh chayqaydi va ko'prik o'rtasidan jilmaydi."

#: games/journey.py:250
msgid "The Ferryman"
msgstr "Qayiqchi"

#: games/journey.py:251
msgid ""
"The ferryman is already pushing off. \"One question, quickly, or you wait "
"for the next crossing.\""
msgstr ""
"Qayiqchi allaqachon suzib ketyapti. «Bitta savol, tez — bo'lmasa keyingi "
"safarni kutasiz»."

#: games/journey.py:252
msgid "He swings the boat back around and holds it steady for you."
msgstr "U qayiqni orqaga burib, siz uchun mahkam ushlab turadi."

#: games/journey.py:253
msgid "The boat glides out into the current without you."
msgstr "Qayiq sizsiz oqim tomon suzib ketadi."

#: games/journey.py:255
msgid "The Stepping Stones"
msgstr "Kechuv toshlari"

#: games/journey.py:256
msgid ""
"Stones cross the water, but only some of them are steady. Which ones — that "
"has to be worked out from the bank."
msgstr ""
"Toshlar suvdan o'tkazadi, lekin ularning ba'zilarigina mustahkam. Qaysilari "
"ekanini qirg'oqda turib hisoblash kerak."

#: games/journey.py:257
msgid "Every stone you chose holds firm. Dry feet on the far side."
msgstr ""
"Siz tanlagan har bir tosh mustahkam turadi. Narigi qirg'oqqa oyoq quruq "
"yetib borasiz."

#: games/journey.py:258
msgid "The stone tilts under your foot and you jump back to the bank."
msgstr "Tosh oyog'ingiz ostida qiyshayadi va siz qirg'oqqa sakrab qaytasiz."

#: games/journey.py:260
msgid "The Flooded Ford"
msgstr "Suv bosgan kechuv"

#: games/journey.py:261
msgid ""
"The ford is deeper than it looks. A traveller waits on the bank, working out "
"how deep — and she is stuck on the sum."
msgstr ""
"Kechuv ko'ringanidan chuqurroq. Qirg'oqda bir yo'lovchi qanchaligini "
"hisoblab kutib turibdi — va hisobda qotib qolgan."

#: games/journey.py:262
msgid ""
"The two of you wade across together, water at the knee, exactly as "
"calculated."
msgstr ""
"Ikkovingiz birga kechib o'tasiz — suv aynan hisoblanganidek tizzagacha "
"keladi."

#: games/journey.py:263
msgid "Neither of you trusts the water. You both stay put."
msgstr "Ikkovingiz ham suvga ishonmaysiz. Ikkalangiz ham joyingizda qolasiz."

#: games/journey.py:267
msgid "The Rockfall"
msgstr "Tosh ko'chkisi"

#: games/journey.py:268
msgid ""
"Boulders have come down across the pass. There is a way through them, but "
"only one, and it has to be reasoned out."
msgstr ""
"Dovonni katta toshlar to'sib qo'ygan. Ular orasidan o'tadigan yo'l bor, "
"lekin bittagina — uni fikrlab topish kerak."

#: games/journey.py:269
msgid "You thread the gap. The stones stay where they are."
msgstr "Siz tirqishdan o'tasiz. Toshlar joyida qoladi."

#: games/journey.py:270
msgid "Loose scree slides under your boots and you back away."
msgstr "Mayda toshlar oyog'ingiz ostidan sirg'aladi va siz orqaga chekinasiz."

#: games/journey.py:272
msgid "The Goat Path"
msgstr "Echki so'qmog'i"

#: games/journey.py:273
msgid ""
"A goatherd blocks the narrow path with his flock. \"This trail is dangerous. "
"Prove you are thinking clearly today.\""
msgstr ""
"Cho'pon podasi bilan tor so'qmoqni to'sib turibdi. «Bu so'qmoq xavfli. Bugun "
"boshingiz tiniq ishlayotganini isbotlang»."

#: games/journey.py:274
msgid "He whistles; the goats part like water. \"Go carefully.\""
msgstr ""
"U hushtak chaladi; echkilar suvdek ikkiga bo'linadi. «Ehtiyot bo'lib boring»."

#: games/journey.py:275
msgid "He plants his staff. \"Not today, then.\""
msgstr "U hassasini yerga tirab qo'yadi. «Bugun bo'lmasa, boshqa kuni»."

#: games/journey.py:277
msgid "The Eagle"
msgstr "Burgut"

#: games/journey.py:278
msgid ""
"An eagle drops onto the rock in front of you with something bright in its "
"claws. It will trade — but not for food."
msgstr ""
"Burgut oldingizdagi qoyaga qo'nadi, changalida yaltiroq narsa bor. U "
"almashishga rozi — lekin ovqatga emas."

#: games/journey.py:279
msgid "It opens its claws, takes off, and shows you the ridge line from above."
msgstr ""
"U changalini ochadi, uchib ko'tariladi va tepadan qir chizig'ini ko'rsatadi."

#: games/journey.py:280
msgid "It watches you for a long moment, then looks away."
msgstr "U sizga uzoq tikilib turadi, so'ng nigohini olib qochadi."

#: games/journey.py:282
msgid "The Snow Line"
msgstr "Qor chizig‘i"

#: games/journey.py:283
msgid ""
"Above this point the snow starts. An old shepherd will lend you his coat, if "
"you can keep up with him in conversation."
msgstr ""
"Shu joydan tepada qor boshlanadi. Keksa cho'pon to'nini beradi — agar "
"suhbatda undan orqada qolmasangiz."

#: games/journey.py:284
msgid "The coat is heavy and warm and smells of woodsmoke. He waves you on."
msgstr "To'n og'ir, issiq va tutun hidi keladi. U qo'l silkib yo'lga soladi."

#: games/journey.py:285
msgid "He pulls the coat tighter around himself and says nothing."
msgstr "U to'nini o'ziga mahkamroq o'raydi va indamaydi."

#: games/journey.py:289
msgid "The Stone Door"
msgstr "Tosh eshik"

#: games/journey.py:290
msgid ""
"A slab of rock seals the tunnel, and a question is cut into it. Doors like "
"this have been opened by thinking for a thousand years."
msgstr ""
"Tunnelni tosh plita berkitgan, unga savol o'yilgan. Bunday eshiklar ming "
"yildan beri fikr bilan ochib kelinadi."

#: games/journey.py:291
msgid "The slab grinds inward. Cold air comes out of the dark."
msgstr "Plita g'ijirlab ichkariga suriladi. Zulmatdan sovuq havo uriladi."

#: games/journey.py:292
msgid "The stone does not move a hair. It has all the time in the world."
msgstr "Tosh qilcha ham qimirlamaydi. Uning vaqti cheksiz."

#: games/journey.py:294
msgid "The Echo"
msgstr "Aks-sado"

#: games/journey.py:295
msgid ""
"Something in the dark repeats every word you say — and then asks you a "
"question in your own voice."
msgstr ""
"Zulmatdagi allanarsa har bir so'zingizni takrorlaydi — so'ng sizning "
"ovozingizda savol beradi."

#: games/journey.py:296
msgid "The echo repeats your answer once, approvingly, and fades."
msgstr "Aks-sado javobingizni bir marta ma'qullab takrorlaydi va o'chadi."

#: games/journey.py:297
msgid "The echo repeats your answer, over and over, until you stop listening."
msgstr ""
"Aks-sado javobingizni qayta-qayta takrorlayveradi — quloq solishdan "
"to'xtaguningizcha."

#: games/journey.py:299
msgid "The Lantern Moth"
msgstr "Chiroq kapalak"

#: games/journey.py:300
msgid ""
"One enormous moth glows in the passage. It only lights the way for "
"travellers who are paying attention."
msgstr ""
"Yo'lakda bitta ulkan kapalak yorug'lik sochadi. U faqat diqqat bilan "
"qaraydigan yo'lovchilarga yo'l yoritadi."

#: games/journey.py:301
msgid "It flares bright and drifts ahead of you down the tunnel."
msgstr "U yorqin alangalanadi va tunnel bo'ylab oldingizda suzib boradi."

#: games/journey.py:302
msgid "Its light dims to almost nothing, and the tunnel closes in."
msgstr "Uning nuri deyarli so'nadi va tunnel qisib kelayotgandek tuyuladi."

#: games/journey.py:304
msgid "The Underground River"
msgstr "Yer osti daryosi"

#: games/journey.py:305
msgid ""
"Black water runs fast through the cave. Somewhere there is a ledge wide "
"enough to walk — the trick is working out where."
msgstr ""
"G'ordan qora suv tez oqadi. Qayerdadir yurish mumkin bo'lgan tokcha bor — "
"gap uni qayerda ekanini hisoblashda."

#: games/journey.py:306
msgid "The ledge is exactly where the reasoning put it. You edge along it."
msgstr "Tokcha aynan mulohaza aytgan joyda. Siz u bo'ylab yon berib o'tasiz."

#: games/journey.py:307
msgid "You cannot see the ledge, and guessing here would be foolish."
msgstr "Tokchani ko'rmayapsiz, bu yerda taxmin qilish esa aqlsizlik bo'lardi."

#: games/journey.py:311
msgid "The Sandstorm"
msgstr "Qum bo'roni"

#: games/journey.py:312
msgid ""
"The horizon has gone brown. There is time to reach shelter, but only if you "
"pick the right direction, and only right now."
msgstr ""
"Ufq jigarrang tusga kirdi. Panohga yetib olishga vaqt bor — faqat to'g'ri "
"yo'nalishni tanlasangiz va aynan hozir."

#: games/journey.py:313
msgid "You reach the rock overhang as the first sand hits. Close."
msgstr "Birinchi qum urilganda qoya soyaboniga yetib olasiz. Zo'rg'a."

#: games/journey.py:314
msgid "The wind turns you around and pushes you back the way you came."
msgstr "Shamol sizni burib, kelgan yo'lingizga qaytarib itaradi."

#: games/journey.py:316
msgid "The Mirage"
msgstr "Sarob"

#: games/journey.py:317
msgid ""
"There is water ahead. Or there is not. Only careful thinking tells the "
"difference out here."
msgstr ""
"Oldinda suv bor. Yoki yo'q. Bu yerda farqni faqat sinchkov fikr ajratadi."

#: games/journey.py:318
msgid "The water is real. You drink, and fill the skin."
msgstr "Suv haqiqiy. Ichasiz va meshni to'ldirasiz."

#: games/journey.py:319
msgid "You walk toward it for an hour, and it walks away from you."
msgstr "Bir soat unga tomon yurasiz, u esa sizdan uzoqlashib boraveradi."

#: games/journey.py:321
msgid "The Well Keeper"
msgstr "Quduq egasi"

#: games/journey.py:322
msgid ""
"The only well for a day's walk has a woman sitting on its lid. \"Everyone "
"drinks here,\" she says. \"Everyone answers first.\""
msgstr ""
"Bir kunlik yo'ldagi yagona quduq qopqog'ida bir ayol o'tiribdi. «Bu yerda "
"hamma suv ichadi, — deydi u. — Hamma avval javob beradi»."

#: games/journey.py:323
msgid "She slides the lid off and lowers the bucket herself."
msgstr "U qopqoqni surib, chelakni o'zi tushiradi."

#: games/journey.py:324
msgid "She stays exactly where she is, and so does the lid."
msgstr "U ham joyidan qimirlamaydi, qopqoq ham."

#: games/journey.py:326
msgid "The Salt Flat"
msgstr "Sho'rxok"

#: games/journey.py:327
msgid ""
"The crust is thin in places and will hold in others. A line of old "
"footprints stops halfway across."
msgstr ""
"Qatlam ba'zi joyda yupqa, ba'zi joyda bardosh beradi. Eski oyoq izlari yarim "
"yo'lda uzilib qolgan."

#: games/journey.py:328
msgid "Your route holds all the way. You do not look back at the footprints."
msgstr ""
"Tanlagan yo'lingiz oxirigacha bardosh beradi. Oyoq izlariga orqangizga qarab "
"ham qo'ymaysiz."

#: games/journey.py:329
msgid "The crust creaks underfoot and you retreat to firm ground."
msgstr "Qatlam oyoq ostida g'ichirlaydi va siz qattiq yerga chekinasiz."

#: games/journey.py:333
msgid "The Outer Gate"
msgstr "Tashqi darvoza"

#: games/journey.py:334
msgid ""
"The city wall rises out of the plain. The outer gate is open, but a clerk "
"with a ledger stands in it."
msgstr ""
"Tekislikdan shahar devori ko'tariladi. Tashqi darvoza ochiq, lekin unda "
"daftar ushlagan mirza turibdi."

#: games/journey.py:335
msgid "He writes your name in the ledger and stands aside."
msgstr "U ismingizni daftarga yozadi va chetga suriladi."

#: games/journey.py:336
msgid "He closes the ledger. \"Come back when you are ready.\""
msgstr "U daftarni yopadi. «Tayyor bo'lganingizda qayting»."

#: games/journey.py:340
msgid "A Fire in the Clearing"
msgstr "Yalanglikdagi gulxan"

#: games/journey.py:341
msgid ""
"Somebody has left a fire burning and a stack of dry wood beside it. Sit "
"down. Nothing is chasing you."
msgstr ""
"Kimdir gulxanni yoqib ketgan, yonida quruq o'tin uyumi. O'tiring. Sizni hech "
"kim quvlayotgani yo'q."

#: games/journey.py:342
msgid ""
"You rest until your legs stop aching, and bank the fire for the next "
"traveller."
msgstr ""
"Oyog'ingiz og'rig'i bosilguncha dam olasiz va keyingi yo'lovchi uchun "
"cho'g'ni ko'mib qo'yasiz."

#: games/journey.py:345
msgid "The Hot Spring"
msgstr "Issiq buloq"

#: games/journey.py:346
msgid ""
"Steam rises out of the rocks, and the water is exactly as hot as it should "
"be. This is not a trap. Not everything is."
msgstr ""
"Toshlar orasidan bug' ko'tariladi, suv esa aynan kerakligicha issiq. Bu "
"tuzoq emas. Hamma narsa ham tuzoq emas."

#: games/journey.py:347
msgid "You climb out warm to the bone and ready for the pass."
msgstr "Suyagingizgacha isib chiqasiz va dovonga tayyor bo'lasiz."

#: games/journey.py:350
msgid "The Oasis"
msgstr "Voha"

#: games/journey.py:351
msgid ""
"Palms, shade, and water that is definitely water this time. Travellers sleep "
"here in the heat of the day."
msgstr ""
"Palmalar, soya va bu safar aniq suv bo'lgan suv. Yo'lovchilar kunning "
"issig'ida shu yerda uxlaydi."

#: games/journey.py:352
msgid "You wake in the cool of the evening, water skin full."
msgstr "Kechki salqinda uyg'onasiz, meshingiz to'la."

#: games/journey.py:355
msgid "The Shepherd's Hut"
msgstr "Cho'pon kulbasi"

#: games/journey.py:356
msgid ""
"A one-room hut with the door on the latch, bread on the shelf, and a note "
"that says: leave it as you found it."
msgstr ""
"Bir xonali kulba: eshigi ilgakda, tokchada non, va xat: qanday topgan "
"bo'lsangiz, shunday qoldiring."

#: games/journey.py:357
msgid "You sleep on the floor by the stove and leave bread for the next one."
msgstr "O'choq yonida yerda uxlaysiz va keyingisi uchun non qoldirasiz."

#: games/journey.py:360
msgid "The Inn at the Crossing"
msgstr "Kechuvdagi mehmonxona"

#: games/journey.py:361
msgid ""
"An inn on the riverbank, full of people going the other way, all of them "
"with advice."
msgstr ""
"Daryo bo'yidagi mehmonxona — qarama-qarshi tomonga ketayotganlarga to'la, "
"hammasining maslahati bor."

#: games/journey.py:362
msgid ""
"You eat, you listen, and you leave in the morning stronger than you arrived."
msgstr ""
"Ovqatlanasiz, tinglaysiz va ertalab kelganingizdan kuchliroq yo'lga chiqasiz."

#: games/journey.py:367
msgid "Something Buried"
msgstr "Ko'milgan narsa"

#: games/journey.py:368
msgid ""
"A corner of a wooden box shows through the leaf mould. It has been here a "
"long time, and it is not locked."
msgstr ""
"Chirigan barglar orasidan yog'och quti burchagi ko'rinib turibdi. U bu yerda "
"uzoq yotgan va qulflanmagan."

#: games/journey.py:369
msgid "It comes out of the ground with a sucking sound. Heavier than it looks."
msgstr "U yerdan shopillab chiqadi. Ko'ringanidan og'irroq."

#: games/journey.py:372
msgid "The Merchant's Thanks"
msgstr "Savdogarning rahmati"

#: games/journey.py:373
msgid ""
"A merchant you helped at the last crossing catches up with you, out of "
"breath, holding something out."
msgstr ""
"O'tgan kechuvda yordam bergan savdogaringiz hansirab yetib keladi, qo'lida "
"nimadir uzatib."

#: games/journey.py:374
msgid "\"Take it, take it,\" he says, and is gone before you can argue."
msgstr "«Oling, oling», — deydi u va siz e'tiroz bildirguncha g'oyib bo'ladi."

#: games/journey.py:377
msgid "The Sunken Crate"
msgstr "Cho'kkan quti"

#: games/journey.py:378
msgid ""
"A crate is wedged under the bank, half in the water. Whatever is inside has "
"stayed dry."
msgstr ""
"Qirg'oq ostiga quti tiqilib qolgan, yarmi suvda. Ichidagi nima bo'lsa ham "
"quruq qolgan."

#: games/journey.py:379
msgid "You lever it loose and prise the lid up on the gravel."
msgstr "Uni qo'zg'ab bo'shatasiz va shag'al ustida qopqog'ini ko'tarasiz."

#: games/journey.py:382
msgid "The Little Hoard"
msgstr "Kichik xazina"

#: games/journey.py:383
msgid ""
"Somebody hid something in this crack in the wall and never came back for it. "
"That was probably a long time ago."
msgstr ""
"Kimdir devordagi shu yoriqqa nimanidir yashirgan va uni olgani qaytmagan. "
"Bu, ehtimol, juda ko'p yil oldin bo'lgan."

#: games/journey.py:384
msgid "It fits in one hand, and it is worth carrying. Or worth leaving."
msgstr ""
"U bir kaftga sig'adi va ko'tarib ketishga arziydi. Yoki qoldirib ketishga."

#: games/journey.py:389
msgid "The Woman at the Crossroads"
msgstr "Chorrahadagi kampir"

#: games/journey.py:390
msgid ""
"She has been sitting on that wall for longer than the wall has been there, "
"and she has an opinion about your route."
msgstr ""
"U o'sha devorda devorning o'zidan ham uzoqroq o'tiribdi va sizning yo'lingiz "
"haqida o'z fikri bor."

#: games/journey.py:391
msgid "She tells you one true thing and goes back to watching the road."
msgstr "U sizga bitta rost gapni aytadi va yana yo'lni kuzatishga qaytadi."

#: games/journey.py:394
msgid "The Wandering Poet"
msgstr "Sayoq shoir"

#: games/journey.py:395
msgid ""
"He is walking the other way and singing something with too many verses. He "
"stops when he sees you."
msgstr ""
"U qarama-qarshi tomonga ketyapti va bandlari haddan tashqari ko'p qo'shiqni "
"aytyapti. Sizni ko'rib to'xtaydi."

#: games/journey.py:396
msgid "He gives you the last verse, which turns out to be directions."
msgstr "U sizga oxirgi bandni beradi — u yo'l ko'rsatma bo'lib chiqadi."

#: games/journey.py:401
msgid "The Captain of the Gate"
msgstr "Darvoza sardori"

#: games/journey.py:402
msgid ""
"The inner gate. The captain has your whole journey written on the page in "
"front of her — and she asks about the road behind you, not the road ahead. "
"\"Three questions,\" she says. \"You may miss one.\""
msgstr ""
"Ichki darvoza. Sardorning oldidagi varaqda butun safaringiz yozilgan — u "
"oldingi yo'l haqida emas, ortda qolgan yo'l haqida so'raydi. «Uchta savol, — "
"deydi u. — Bittasida adashsangiz bo'ladi»."

#: games/journey.py:403
msgid "She stamps the page and hauls the gate open herself. You are through."
msgstr "U varaqqa muhr bosadi va darvozani o'z qo'li bilan ochadi. O'tdingiz."

#: games/journey.py:404
msgid ""
"She closes the ledger gently. \"You know most of this. Go and find the rest."
"\""
msgstr ""
"U daftarni ohista yopadi. «Buning ko'pini bilasiz. Borib qolganini ham "
"toping»."

#: games/journey.py:406
msgid "The Stone Giant"
msgstr "Tosh dev"

#: games/journey.py:407
msgid ""
"It has been sitting in the pass so long that trees grow on its shoulders. It "
"opens one eye. It wants to know what you learned on the way here — all of "
"it, not just the last bit."
msgstr ""
"U dovonda shu qadar uzoq o'tirganki, yelkasida daraxt o'sib ketgan. Bir "
"ko'zini ochadi. U bu yergacha nima o'rganganingizni bilmoqchi — hammasini, "
"faqat oxirgisini emas."

#: games/journey.py:408
msgid "It stands, and the ground shakes, and the road behind it is open."
msgstr "U o'rnidan turadi, yer larzaga keladi va uning ortidagi yo'l ochiladi."

#: games/journey.py:409
msgid ""
"It closes its eye again. It is in no hurry, and it will be here when you "
"return."
msgstr ""
"U yana ko'zini yumadi. Shoshilmaydi va qaytib kelganingizda ham shu yerda "
"bo'ladi."

#: games/journey.py:411
msgid "The Keeper of the Road Book"
msgstr "Yo'l daftari egasi"

#: games/journey.py:412
msgid ""
"Every traveller who ever walked this leg is written in his book. He turns to "
"your page, which is nearly full, and asks about the beginning of it."
msgstr ""
"Bu bosqichni bosib o'tgan har bir yo'lovchi uning daftariga yozilgan. U "
"deyarli to'lgan sahifangizni ochadi va uning boshi haqida so'raydi."

#: games/journey.py:413
msgid "He signs the bottom of your page and turns to a fresh one."
msgstr "U sahifangiz ostiga imzo qo'yadi va yangi varaqni ochadi."

#: games/journey.py:414
msgid "He leaves your page open. \"Unfinished is not the same as failed.\""
msgstr ""
"U sahifangizni ochiq qoldiradi. «Tugallanmagan degani muvaffaqiyatsiz degani "
"emas»."

#: games/journey.py:416
msgid "The Dragon of the Last Crossing"
msgstr "Oxirgi kechuv ajdari"

#: games/journey.py:417
msgid ""
"It is coiled around the last bridge, and it is far more interested in "
"talking than in eating. It asks about the whole road, from the very first "
"step."
msgstr ""
"U oxirgi ko'prikni o'rab olgan va yeyishdan ko'ra suhbatlashishga ancha "
"qiziqadi. U butun yo'l haqida, eng birinchi qadamdan boshlab so'raydi."

#: games/journey.py:418
msgid "It uncoils, unhurried, and lets you walk the length of the bridge."
msgstr "U shoshilmay yoziladi va ko'prik bo'ylab o'tishingizga yo'l beradi."

#: games/journey.py:419
msgid ""
"It settles back down across the planks. \"Again, later. I am not going "
"anywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"U yana taxtalar ustiga cho'kadi. «Keyinroq, yana. Men qochib ketmayman»."

#: games/journey.py:444
msgid "The high road"
msgstr "Baland yo'l"

#: games/journey.py:445
msgid "Shorter and meaner. Pays double."
msgstr "Qisqaroq va shafqatsizroq. Ikki barobar to'laydi."

#: games/journey.py:450
msgid "The long way round"
msgstr "Aylanma yo'l"

#: games/journey.py:451
msgid "Gentler, but you lose time. Pays less."
msgstr "Yumshoqroq, lekin vaqt yo'qotasiz. Kamroq to'laydi."

#: games/journey.py:456
msgid "The old track"
msgstr "Eski so'qmoq"

#: games/journey.py:457
msgid "Middling — and somebody left a torch on it."
msgstr "O'rtacha — va kimdir unda mash'al qoldirib ketgan."

#: games/journey.py:891
msgid "You find a torch left on the old track."
msgstr "Eski so'qmoqda qoldirilgan mash'alni topasiz."

#: games/journey.py:971
msgid ""
"Your last heart is gone. Only proving a lesson will get you back on your "
"feet."
msgstr ""
"Oxirgi yuragingiz ham ketdi. Faqat darsni isbotlash sizni oyoqqa turg'izadi."

#: games/journey.py:981
msgid "The road beat you this time. What you left behind stays where it lies."
msgstr "Bu safar yo'l sizni yengdi. Qoldirib ketganingiz o'sha yerda qoladi."

#: games/journey.py:992
msgid ""
"You proved a lesson and got back on your feet. There is no second reprieve."
msgstr "Darsni isbotlab, oyoqqa turdingiz. Ikkinchi imkoniyat bo'lmaydi."

