"yetib kelgan darsdan olingan haqiqiy savolga."

#: games/templates/games/journey_home.html:19
msgid ""
"Three hearts a stage, and they never come back on their own. Two wrong "
"answers cost one; run out and the stage is lost, along with any prize you "
"left on the road. Passing a lesson's practice is the only thing that returns "
"a heart."
