"bosqich boshida bir marta beriladi: jami oltita xatoga o'rin bor. Ikkita "
"noto'g'ri javob bittasini oladi, qayerda bo'lishidan qat'i nazar. Dam olish "
"ularni qaytarmaydi."

#: games/templates/games/journey_home.html:83
msgid "Only proof heals"
msgstr "Faqat isbot davolaydi"

#: games/templates/games/journey_home.html:83
msgid ""
"passing a lesson's practice is the one thing that returns a heart — and it "
"opens a sealed gate without the guard asking anything."
msgstr ""
"darsning mashqidan o'tish — yurakni qaytaradigan yagona narsa, va u berk "
