"bo'lmadingiz."

#: games/views.py:2913
#, python-format
msgid "You passed the test on \"%(lesson)s\". That is proof, not a promise."
msgstr "«%(lesson)s» bo'yicha testdan o'tdingiz. Bu — va'da emas, isbot."

#: games/views.py:2927
msgid ""
"You read the story that goes with the lesson — someone hands you a torch."
msgstr "Darsga tegishli hikoyani o'qidingiz — kimdir sizga mash'al uzatadi."

#: games/views.py:3138
#, python-format
msgid "You set out for %(place)s."
msgstr "%(place)s tomon yo'lga chiqdingiz."

#: games/views.py:3249
msgid ""
"You rest. No wound closes, but the slate is clean and there is a torch by "
"the fire."
msgstr ""
"Dam olasiz. Hech qanday yara bitmaydi, lekin hisob tozalandi va gulxan "
"yonida mash'al bor."

#: games/views.py:3264
msgid "You shoulder what was in the chest. It is heavier than it looked."
msgstr "Sandiqdagi narsani yelkaga olasiz. U ko'ringanidan og'irroq."

#: games/views.py:3267
msgid "You leave it where it lies, and travel light."
msgstr "Uni yotgan joyida qoldirasiz va yengil yo'lga tushasiz."

#: games/views.py:3284
msgid "You strike a torch — two wrong paths fall into shadow."
msgstr "Mash'al yoqasiz — ikkita noto'g'ri yo'l soyaga cho'kadi."

#: games/views.py:3292
#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s stands aside — you proved this lesson the hard way."
msgstr "%(who)s chetga suriladi — bu darsni mashaqqat bilan isbotladingiz."

#: games/views.py:3330
msgid "You square your shoulders and try the way again."
msgstr "Yelkangizni rostlab, yo'lni yana bir bor sinab ko'rasiz."

#: games/views.py:3346
msgid "You turn back to the fork and look at the other way."
msgstr "Ayrilishga qaytib, ikkinchi yo'lga qaraysiz."

#: games/views.py:3402
msgid "The way is shut. You will have to study or go around."
msgstr "Yo'l berk. Endi o'qishingiz yoki aylanib o'tishingiz kerak."

#: games/views.py:3417
msgid ""
"You answered the riddle. The stranger gives you a torch and goes back to "
"watching the road."
msgstr ""
"Jumboqni yechdingiz. Notanish odam sizga mash'al berib, yana yo'lni "
"kuzatishga qaytadi."

#: games/views.py:3420
msgid "The riddle beats you, but the stranger explains it before you part."
msgstr ""
"Jumboq sizni yengdi, lekin xayrlashishdan oldin notanish odam uni "
"tushuntirib beradi."

#: games/views.py:3446
#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s lets you pass."
msgstr "%(who)s sizni o'tkazib yuboradi."

#: games/views.py:3456
#, python-format
msgid "You reach %(place)s."
msgstr "%(place)s — yetib keldingiz!"

