#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:476
msgid "Strong mind bends the line."
msgstr "Kuchli aql chizig'ni egadi."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:478
msgid ""
"A learning platform built for curious minds — where students grow through "
"structured practice, mentorship from expert masters, and a community that "
"pushes boundaries together."
msgstr ""
"Qiziquvchan onglar uchun qurilgan ta'lim platformasi — o'quvchilar tizimli "
"mashqlar, mutaxassis ustozlarning mentorlik va chegaralarni kengaytiruvchi "
"jamoa orqali rivojlanadigan joy."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:482 prime/templates/prime/help.html:363
#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:889
msgid "Start Practicing"
msgstr "Mashqni boshlash"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:498
msgid "Free to Start"
msgstr "Bepul boshlash"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:502
msgid "Clear Goal"
msgstr "Aniq maqsad"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:506
msgid "Every Learner"
msgstr "Har bir o'quvchi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:513
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Bizning maqsadimiz"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:514
msgid "Sharpening minds,"
msgstr "Onglarni charxlash,"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:514
msgid "one question at a time."
msgstr "har bir savol bilan."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:517
msgid ""
"Prime Point was founded on a simple belief: the best way to build a strong "
"mind is through deliberate, structured practice. We connect passionate "
"learners with expert masters and give them the tools to grow — at their own "
"pace, on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"Prime Point oddiy bir e'tiqod asosida tashkil etilgan: kuchli ong qurishning "
"eng yaxshi yo'li — maqsadli, tizimli mashq. Biz ishtiyoqli o'quvchilarni "
"mutaxassis ustozlar bilan bog'laymiz va ularga o'sish uchun qurollar beramiz "
"— o'z sur'atlarida, o'z shartlarida."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:520
msgid ""
"We are not just a quiz app. We are a full learning ecosystem — from homework "
"assignments to live discussion, from beginner practices to expert-level "
"challenges."
msgstr ""
"Biz shunchaki viktorina ilovasi emasmiz. Biz to'liq ta'lim ekotizimizmiz — "
"uy vazifalaridan jonli muhokamagacha, boshlang'ich mashqlardan ekspert "
"darajasidagi qiyinchiliklargacha."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:527
msgid "Deliberate Practice"
msgstr "Maqsadli mashq"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:528
msgid "Targeted, measurable improvement every session"
msgstr "Har bir mashg'ulotda aniq va o'lchovli taraqqiyot"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:534
msgid "Expert Mentorship"
msgstr "Mutaxassis mentorlik"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:535
msgid "Learn directly from masters in their field"
msgstr "O'z sohasidagi ustozlardan bevosita o'rganing"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:541
msgid "Visible Progress"
msgstr "Ko'rinadigan taraqqiyot"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:542
msgid "Track your rank from Novice to Grandmaster"
msgstr "Yangilikdan Grandmastergacha darajangizni kuzating"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:548
msgid "Community Learning"
msgstr "Jamoaviy ta'lim"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:549
msgid "Discuss, debate, and grow alongside peers"
msgstr "Tengdoshlar bilan muhokama qiling va birgalikda rivojlaning"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:557
msgid "What We Offer"
msgstr "Nima taklif etamiz"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:558
msgid "Everything you need to level up."
msgstr "Darajangizni oshirish uchun hamma narsa."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:565
msgid ""
"Hundreds of curated practice sessions across subjects and difficulty levels. "
"Filter by topic, master, or level — and track your score every attempt."
msgstr ""
"Turli fanlar va qiyinlik darajalari bo'yicha yuzlab tanlangan mashq "
"sessiyalari. Mavzu, ustoz yoki daraja bo'yicha filtrlang — va har bir "
"urinishda natijangizni kuzating."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:569 prime/templates/prime/help.html:588
msgid "Homework System"
msgstr "Uy vazifasi tizimi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:570
msgid ""
"Masters assign targeted practice as homework to individual students or "
"groups. Deadlines, auto-grading, and submission tracking built in."
msgstr ""
"Ustozlar alohida o'quvchilarga yoki guruhlarga uy vazifasi sifatida maqsadli "
"mashqlar tayinlaydi. Muddatlar, avtomatik baholash va topshiriqlarni "
"kuzatish o'rnatilgan."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:574
msgid "Master Profiles"
msgstr "Ustoz profillari"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:575
msgid ""
"Follow experts in your field. Each master curates their own practice library "
"and can guide their students through structured learning paths."
msgstr ""
"Sohangizdagi mutaxassislarni kuzating. Har bir ustoz o'zining mashqlar "
"kutubxonasini boshqaradi va tizimli o'quv yo'llari orqali o'quvchilarini "
"yo'naltiradi."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:579 prime/templates/prime/help.html:682
msgid "Discussion Forum"
msgstr "Muhokama forumi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:580
msgid ""
"Engage with the community — ask questions, share insights, vote on answers, "
"and learn from conversations that go beyond the practice sheet."
msgstr ""
"Jamoa bilan muloqot qiling — savollar bering, fikrlar ulashing, javoblarga "
"ovoz bering va mashq varag'idan tashqariga chiqadigan suhbatlardan o'rganing."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:584 prime/templates/prime/help.html:712
msgid "Rank System"
msgstr "Daraja tizimi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:585
msgid ""
"Earn points through practice and climb from Novice to Grandmaster. Your rank "
"reflects your dedication — and motivates you to keep going."
msgstr ""
"Mashq orqali ball to'plang va Yangilikdan Grandmastergacha ko'tariling. "
"Darajangiz fidoyiligingizni aks ettiradi — va davom etishga undaydi."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:590
msgid ""
"Masters see exactly where each student struggles — question by question, "
"choice by choice. Targeted feedback becomes effortless."
msgstr ""
"Ustozlar har bir o'quvchining qayerda qiynalayotganini aniq ko'radi — savol "
"savoldan, tanlov tanlovdan. Maqsadli fikr-mulohaza berish osonlashadi."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:596
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Qanday ishlaydi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:597
msgid "Simple steps. Real results."
msgstr "Oddiy qadamlar. Haqiqiy natijalar."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:603
msgid "Create your account"
msgstr "Hisobingizni yarating"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:604
msgid ""
"Sign up free in seconds. Build your student profile and choose your learning "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"Soniyalar ichida bepul ro'yxatdan o'ting. O'quvchi profilingizni yarating va "
"o'quv maqsadlaringizni belgilang."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:608 prime/templates/prime/help.html:385
msgid "Follow a Master"
msgstr "Ustozni kuzating"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:609
msgid ""
"Browse expert masters and follow the ones whose subjects align with your "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"Mutaxassis ustozlarni ko'rib chiqing va maqsadlaringizga mos keladiganlarini "
"kuzating."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:613
msgid "Practice & Submit"
msgstr "Mashq qiling va topshiring"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:614
msgid ""
"Take timed or open-ended practice sessions. Submit homework assigned by your "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"Vaqt chegaralangan yoki ochiq mashq sessiyalarini bajaring. Ustozlaringiz "
"tomonidan berilgan uy vazifalarini topshiring."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:618
msgid "Review & Grow"
msgstr "Tahlil qiling va rivojlaning"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:619
msgid ""
"See detailed feedback on every answer. Improve your weak points. Rise "
"through the ranks."
msgstr ""
"Har bir javob uchun batafsil fikr-mulohaza ko'ring. Zaif tomonlaringizni "
"yaxshilang. Darajangizni oshiring."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:625
msgid "The Team"
msgstr "Jamoa"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:626
msgid "Built by people who care about learning."
msgstr "O'rganishga g'amxo'r odamlar tomonidan qurilgan."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:706 prime/templates/prime/about.html:713
msgid "Partners"
msgstr "Hamkorlar"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:706 prime/templates/prime/about.html:744
msgid "Investors"
msgstr "Investorlar"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:707
msgid "Backed by believers."
msgstr "Ishonuvchilar tomonidan qo'llab-quvvatlanadi."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:710
msgid ""
"We are actively building partnerships with educational institutions, EdTech "
"investors, and technology companies that share our vision of accessible, "
"quality learning."
msgstr ""
"Biz ta'lim muassasalari, EdTech investorlari va qulay, sifatli ta'lim "
"bo'yicha bizning qarashlarga qo'shiladigan texnologiya kompaniyalari bilan "
"hamkorlik qilamiz."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:721
msgid "Social Initiative"
msgstr "Ijtimoiy tashabbus"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:730
msgid "Government Agency"
msgstr "Davlat idorasi"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:739
msgid "Local Government"
msgstr "Mahalliy hokimiyat"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:749
msgid "Seed Investor"
msgstr "Boshlang'ich investor"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:750
msgid "EdTech — Incoming"
msgstr "EdTech — Kelayotgan"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:756
msgid "Angel Investor"
msgstr "Angel investor"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:757
msgid "Venture — Incoming"
msgstr "Venture — Kelayotgan"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:765
msgid "Interested in partnering or investing?"
msgstr "Hamkorlik yoki investitsiya qilishga qiziqasizmi?"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:766
msgid "Reach out at"
msgstr "Murojaat qiling"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:773
msgid "Stay close"
msgstr "Yaqin boʻling"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:774
msgid "Find us outside the app"
msgstr "Bizni ilovadan tashqarida ham toping"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:784
msgid "Ready to bend the line?"
msgstr "Chizig'ni egishga tayyormisiz?"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:785
msgid ""
"Join Prime Point today — free, fast, and built for minds that want more."
msgstr ""
"Bugun Prime Pointga qo'shiling — bepul, tez va ko'proq istovchi onglar uchun "
"qurilgan."

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:789
msgid "Go to Practices"
msgstr "Mashqlarga o'tish"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:796
msgid "Join Free"
msgstr "Bepul qo'shiling"

#: prime/templates/prime/about.html:799
msgid "Sign In"
msgstr "Kirish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:4 templates/base.html:203
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Yordam"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:5 prime/templates/prime/help.html:357
msgid "Help Center"
msgstr "Yordam markazi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:359
msgid ""
"Everything you need to know about using Prime Point — whether you are a "
"student looking to grow, a master building your classroom, or an educational "
"center onboarding your team."
msgstr ""
"Prime Pointdan foydalanish haqida bilishingiz kerak bo'lgan hamma narsa — "
"o'sishni istagan o'quvchi, darsxonasini qurayotgan ustoz yoki jamoasini "
"o'rgatayotgan ta'lim markazi uchun."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:366 prime/templates/prime/help.html:892
msgid "Browse Masters"
msgstr "Ustozlarni ko'rish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:373
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "Tezkor boshlash"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:374
msgid "Up and running in four steps"
msgstr "To'rt qadamda ishga kiring"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:380
msgid "Create an Account"
msgstr "Hisob yaratish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:381
msgid "Register for free. No payment required — just a username and password."
msgstr ""
"Bepul ro'yxatdan o'ting. To'lov talab qilinmaydi — faqat foydalanuvchi nomi "
"va parol."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:386
msgid ""
"Go to your Profile and use the Masters selector to choose the educators you "
"want to follow."
msgstr ""
"Profilingizga o'ting va kuzatmoqchi bo'lgan o'qituvchilarni tanlash uchun "
"Ustozlar tanlagichidan foydalaning."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:390
msgid "Take a Practice"
msgstr "Mashqni topshirish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:391
msgid ""
"Choose a timed or open-ended practice set and submit your answers to earn "
"points."
msgstr ""
"Vaqtli yoki ochiq mashqlar to'plamini tanlang va ball olish uchun "
"javoblaringizni yuboring."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:395
msgid "Rise in Rank"
msgstr "Darajada ko'tarilish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:396
msgid "Accumulate points and climb from Novice all the way to Grandmaster."
msgstr "Ball to'plang va Yangilikdan Grandmastergacha ko'tariling."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:403
msgid "For Educators"
msgstr "O'qituvchilar uchun"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:404
msgid "Becoming a Master"
msgstr "Ustoz bo'lish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:407
msgid ""
"Masters are approved educators who create content, manage students, and run "
"classrooms. Becoming a Master is a straightforward three-step process."
msgstr ""
"Ustozlar — kontent yaratadiagan, o'quvchilarni boshqaradigan va "
"darsxonalarni yuritadigan tasdiqlangan o'qituvchilar. Ustoz bo'lish uch "
"bosqichli oddiy jarayon."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:416
msgid "Submit Your Application"
msgstr "Arizangizni yuboring"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:417
msgid ""
"Visit the Masters page and click 'Become a Master'. Fill in your name, "
"subject, and a short description."
msgstr ""
"Ustozlar sahifasiga o'ting va 'Ustoz bo'lish' tugmasini bosing. Ismingiz, "
"faning va qisqa tavsifni to'ldiring."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:423
msgid "Await Admin Approval"
msgstr "Admin tasdiqlashini kuting"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:424
msgid ""
"An admin reviews your profile. Your dashboard will show a pending badge "
"while the review is in progress."
msgstr ""
"Admin profilingizni ko'rib chiqadi. Ko'rib chiqish davomida boshqaruv "
"panelingizda kutish belgisi ko'rsatiladi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:430
msgid "Unlock Full Master Tools"
msgstr "Barcha Ustoz vositalarini oching"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:431
msgid ""
"Once approved, you can create practices, assign homework, publish tutorials, "
"and run private classrooms."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlanganingizdan so'ng mashqlar yaratish, uy vazifalari tayinlash, "
"darsliklar chop etish va xususiy darsxonalar yuritish mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:437
msgid "Apply Now"
msgstr "Hozir ariza bering"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:443
msgid "Application Flow"
msgstr "Ariza jarayoni"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:446
msgid "Fill in the Master application form"
msgstr "Ustoz ariza shaklini to'ldiring"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:450
msgid "Pending admin review"
msgstr "Admin ko'rib chiqmoqda"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:455
msgid "Approved — all tools unlocked"
msgstr "Tasdiqlandi — barcha vositalar ochildi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:456
msgid "Approved"
msgstr "Tasdiqlangan"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:464
msgid "Master Capabilities"
msgstr "Ustoz imkoniyatlari"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:465
msgid "What Masters Can Do"
msgstr "Ustozlar nima qila oladi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:468
msgid ""
"Approved Masters have a full suite of teaching and management tools at their "
"disposal."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlangan Ustozlarda o'qitish va boshqarish uchun to'liq vositalar "
"to'plami mavjud."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:474
msgid "Create Practices"
msgstr "Mashqlar yaratish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:475
msgid ""
"Build multiple-choice question sets with difficulty levels (easy / medium / "
"hard), time limits, pass scores, and max attempt caps."
msgstr ""
"Qiyinlik darajasi (oson / o'rta / qiyin), vaqt chegarasi, o'tish bali va "
"maksimal urinishlar bilan test savollari to'plamlari tuzing."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:479
msgid "Manage Students"
msgstr "O'quvchilarni boshqarish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:480
msgid ""
"Each classroom has its own roster, register and payment sheet — so a master "
"teaching two classes never has to untangle one shared pile."
msgstr ""
"Har bir sinfning oʻz roʻyxati, davomat jurnali va toʻlov varagʻi bor — ikki "
"sinf oʻqitadigan ustoz endi bitta aralash uyumni ajratib oʻtirmaydi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:484
msgid "Create Groups"
msgstr "Guruhlar yaratish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:485
msgid ""
"Group students by class, level, or any criteria. Assign homework to a whole "
"group with a single action instead of individually."
msgstr ""
"O'quvchilarni sinf, daraja yoki boshqa mezonlar bo'yicha guruhlang. Har biri "
"alohida o'rniga bitta amal bilan butun guruhga uy vazifasi tayinlang."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:489
msgid "Assign Homework"
msgstr "Uy vazifasi tayinlash"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:490
msgid ""
"Inside the classroom, gather tutorials, practices, readings and exam-prep "
"lessons into one homework, set a deadline, and track every student's "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"Sinf ichida darslik, mashq, oʻqish matni va imtihonga tayyorgarlik "
"darslarini bitta vazifaga yigʻing, muddat qoʻying va har bir oʻquvchining "
"yutugʻini kuzating."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:494
msgid "Write Tutorials"
msgstr "Darsliklar yozish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:495
msgid ""
"Publish rich-text articles with a category, thumbnail, and linked practices. "
"Students can like or dislike your tutorials."
msgstr ""
"Kategoriya, eskiz va bog'langan mashqlar bilan boy matnli maqolalar chop "
"eting. O'quvchilar darsliklaringizni yoqtirishi yoki yoqtirmasligi mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:499
msgid "Run Classrooms"
msgstr "Darsxonalarni yuritish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:500
msgid ""
"A classroom holds everything: lessons, homework, the student roster, "
"attendance, payments, shared notes and links, and its own discussion."
msgstr ""
"Sinf hamma narsani saqlaydi: darslar, uyga vazifa, oʻquvchilar roʻyxati, "
"davomat, toʻlovlar, umumiy qaydlar va havolalar hamda oʻz muhokamasi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:504
msgid "Generate Certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikatlar yaratish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:505
msgid ""
"Issue printable certificates to your students directly from your Master "
"profile page — no third-party tool needed."
msgstr ""
"O'quvchilaringizga Ustoz profili sahifangizdan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chop "
"etiladigan sertifikatlar bering — uchinchi tomon vositasi shart emas."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:512
msgid "For Students"
msgstr "O'quvchilar uchun"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:513
msgid "Student Guide"
msgstr "O'quvchi qo'llanmasi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:519
msgid "How to Choose and Follow a Master"
msgstr "Ustoz qanday tanlanadi va obuna qilinadi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:520
msgid ""
"Browse the Masters list to see all approved educators. Click any master to "
"view their profile, subject, average student score, and the practices they "
"have published."
msgstr ""
"Barcha tasdiqlangan o'qituvchilarni ko'rish uchun Ustozlar ro'yxatiga "
"o'ting. Profilini, fanini, o'quvchilarning o'rtacha balini va chop etilgan "
"mashqlarini ko'rish uchun istalgan ustozga bosing."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:522
msgid "Go to your Profile page after logging in."
msgstr "Kirganingizdan so'ng Profil sahifangizga o'ting."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:523
msgid ""
"Scroll to the Masters section and use the selector to add the masters you "
"want to follow."
msgstr ""
"Ustozlar bo'limiga o'ting va kuzatmoqchi bo'lgan ustozlarni qo'shish uchun "
"tanlagichdan foydalaning."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:524
msgid ""
"Save your profile. The master's practices and homework will now be "
"accessible to you."
msgstr ""
"Profilingizni saqlang. Ustozning mashqlari va uy vazifalari endi sizga ochiq "
"bo'ladi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:525
msgid "You can follow multiple masters at the same time."
msgstr "Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta ustozga obuna bo'lish mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:526
msgid "Remove a master from your selector at any time to unfollow."
msgstr ""
"Obunani bekor qilish uchun istalgan vaqt tanlagichdan ustozni o'chiring."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:531
msgid "How it looks"
msgstr "Qanday ko'rinadi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:534
msgid "Browse Masters page"
msgstr "Ustozlar sahifasini ko'rish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:538
msgid "View master profile & practices"
msgstr "Ustoz profili va mashqlarini ko'rish"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:542
msgid "Open your Profile → Masters selector"
msgstr "Profil → Ustozlar tanlagichini oching"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:546
msgid "Save — now enrolled as a student"
msgstr "Saqlash — endi o'quvchi sifatida ro'yxatdan o'tdingiz"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:555
msgid "Feature Guide"
msgstr "Xususiyatlar bo'yicha qo'llanma"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:556
msgid "Platform Features"
msgstr "Platforma xususiyatlari"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:562
msgid "Practice System"
msgstr "Mashqlar tizimi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:563
msgid ""
"Practices are the core of Prime Point. Each practice is a set of multiple-"
"choice questions created by a master. Masters configure exactly how students "
"experience each practice."
msgstr ""
"Mashqlar Prime Pointning asosi. Har bir mashq ustoz tomonidan yaratilgan "
"ko'p tanlovli savollar to'plami. Ustozlar o'quvchilar har bir mashqni qanday "
"boshdan kechirishini aniq sozlaydi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:565
msgid "Three difficulty levels: Easy, Medium, Hard."
msgstr "Uchta qiyinlik darajasi: Oson, O'rta, Qiyin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:566
msgid ""
"Optional time limit — the timer counts down and auto-submits when it expires."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy vaqt chegarasi — taymer orqaga hisoblaydi va muddati tugaganda "
"avtomatik topshiradi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:567
msgid "Pass score threshold — you must reach this percentage to pass."
msgstr "O'tish bali chegarasi — o'tish uchun ushbu foizga yetishingiz kerak."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:568
msgid ""
"Max attempts cap — masters can limit how many times a student can retry."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal urinishlar chegarasi — ustozlar o'quvchi necha marta qayta "
"urinishini cheklashi mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:569
msgid ""
"Show-answers-after option — correct answers are revealed once the attempt is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri javoblarni ko'rsatish opsiyasi — urinish tugagandan so'ng to'g'ri "
"javoblar ochiladi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:570
msgid ""
"Free and available-for-all flags — masters can open a practice to the entire "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Bepul va hammaga ochiq bayroqlar — ustozlar mashqni butun platforma uchun "
"ochaoladi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:575
msgid "Practice Metadata"
msgstr "Mashq ma'lumotlari"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:579
msgid "Max Attempts"
msgstr "Maks. urinishlar"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:589
msgid ""
"Homework is set inside a classroom, and can hold any mix of tutorials, "
"practices, Corner readings and exam-prep lessons — not just one test."
msgstr ""
"Uyga vazifa sinf ichida beriladi va darslik, mashq, Burchak oʻqish matni "
"hamda imtihon darslarining istalgan aralashmasini saqlay oladi — faqat bitta "
"test emas."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:591
msgid ""
"Open your classroom → Homework → give it a title, optional notes and a due "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Sinfingizni oching → Uyga vazifa → sarlavha, ixtiyoriy izoh va muddat bering."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:592
msgid ""
"Add content from any library. The lists are already narrowed to the "
"classroom's subject, so an English class never sees Russian or SAT material."
msgstr ""
"Istalgan kutubxonadan material qoʻshing. Roʻyxatlar sinfning faniga "
"toraytirilgan, shuning uchun ingliz tili sinfi rus tili yoki SAT materialini "
"koʻrmaydi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:593
msgid ""
"Add a tutorial and its own practice and reading come with it — the three "
"legs of a lesson travel together."
msgstr ""
"Darslik qoʻshsangiz, uning mashqi va oʻqish matni ham birga keladi — "
"darsning uch oyogʻi birga yuradi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:594
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Your progress"
msgid "Or press \\"
msgstr "Sizning natijalaringiz"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:595
msgid ""
"A homework counts as done only when every piece is done — read the tutorial, "
"read the reading, sit the practice."
msgstr ""
"Vazifa faqat hamma qismi bajarilgandagina tugagan hisoblanadi — darslikni "
"oʻqing, matnni oʻqing, mashqni yeching."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:596
msgid ""
"The master sees a progress bar per student, and can leave written feedback "
"and mark it graded."
msgstr ""
"Ustoz har bir oʻquvchi uchun yutuq chizigʻini koʻradi, yozma izoh qoldirib, "
"baholandi deb belgilay oladi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:601 prime/templates/prime/help.html:612
msgid "Submitted"
msgstr "Topshirilgan"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:608
msgid "Assignment Overview"
msgstr "Topshiriq ko'rinishi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:609
msgid "Group: Advanced Class"
msgstr "Guruh: Ilg'or sinf"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:610
msgid "Practice: Grammar Test 3"
msgstr "Mashq: Grammatika testi 3"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:611
msgid "Due date"
msgstr "Topshirish muddati"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:620
msgid "Tutorial System"
msgstr "Darsliklar tizimi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:621
msgid ""
"Tutorials are long-form rich-text articles written by masters. They can "
"include images, formatted text, and links to related practices — turning a "
"lesson into an interactive experience."
msgstr ""
"Darsliklar — ustozlar tomonidan yozilgan boy matnli uzun maqolalar. Ular "
"rasmlar, formatlangan matn va tegishli mashqlarga havolalarni o'z ichiga "
"olishi mumkin — darsni interaktiv tajribaga aylantiradi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:623
msgid "Categories: Mathematics, Korean, Programming, English, Other."
msgstr "Kategoriyalar: Matematika, Koreys, Dasturlash, Ingliz, Boshqa."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:624
msgid "Read time is estimated automatically from the word count."
msgstr "O'qish vaqti so'zlar sonidan avtomatik hisoblanadi."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:625
msgid "Students can like or dislike a tutorial to give the author feedback."
msgstr ""
"O'quvchilar muallifga fikr bildirish uchun darslikni yoqtirishi yoki "
"yoqtirmasligi mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:626
msgid ""
"Link any number of practices to a tutorial so students can test themselves "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"O'quvchilar darhol o'zlarini sinab ko'rishi uchun darslikka istalgan "
"miqdordagi mashqlarni bog'lang."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:627
msgid ""
"View count is tracked so masters can see which tutorials are most popular."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rishlar soni kuzatiladi, shuning uchun ustozlar qaysi darsliklar "
"mashhurligini ko'rishi mumkin."

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:632
msgid "Tutorial Card"
msgstr "Darslik kartasi"

#: prime/templates/prime/help.html:633
